Listening Test

609
00:32:27,078 --> 00:32:30,946
Where is this laptop made?

610
00:32:30,946 --> 00:32:36,280
これ + は + どこ + の + N + ですか = Where is this N from?
Note: どこ = where

611
00:32:36,302 --> 00:32:39,498
Listening Test

612
00:32:39,498 --> 00:32:43,214
It's made in Japan.

613
00:32:43,214 --> 00:32:48,348
日本の + N + です = It’s a Japanese N
