That's a good price!

636
00:34:04,485 --> 00:34:08,025
安い + です + ね = It’s cheap, isn’t it?
Note: 安い (cheap) ↔ 高い (expensive)

637
00:34:08,048 --> 00:34:11,715
Listening Test

638
00:34:11,715 --> 00:34:16,015
Yes, it's very popular.

639
00:34:16,015 --> 00:34:21,915
はい、 + とても + 人気 + が + あります = Yes, it’s very popular.
Note: 人気 = popularity
とても (very) ≒ 大変 (very)

640
00:34:21,938 --> 00:34:25,004
Listening Test

641
00:34:25,004 --> 00:34:28,547
Is it only available in black?

642
00:34:28,547 --> 00:34:33,451
色 + は + 黒 + だけ + ですか = Is it only available in black?
Note: 黒 (black) ↔ 白 (white)
色 = color

643
00:34:33,475 --> 00:34:37,575
Listening Test

644
00:34:37,575 --> 00:34:42,442
No, we also have white and red.

645
00:34:42,442 --> 00:34:49,109
いいえ、 + 白 + と + 赤 + も + あります = No, we also have white and red ones.
Note: 白 (white) ↔ 黒 (black)
赤 = red

646
00:34:49,132 --> 00:34:51,798
Listening Test

647
00:34:51,798 --> 00:34:54,865
Can I see the red one?

648
00:34:54,865 --> 00:34:59,101
赤 + を + 見せて + ください = Please show me the red one.
Note: 見せる = to show

649
00:34:59,124 --> 00:35:02,791
Listening Test

650
00:35:02,791 --> 00:35:07,091
Sure, just a moment, please.

651
00:35:07,091 --> 00:35:12,991
はい、 + 少々 + お + 待ち + ください = Yes, please wait a moment.
Note: 少々 (a little) ≒ 少し (a little)
待つ = to wait

652
00:35:13,014 --> 00:35:15,090
Listening Test

653
00:35:15,090 --> 00:35:17,408
Thank you.

654
00:35:17,408 --> 00:35:20,675
お願いします = Please

655
00:35:20,698 --> 00:35:23,131
