656
00:35:23,131 --> 00:35:25,884
Sorry to keep you waiting.

657
00:35:25,884 --> 00:35:29,751
お待たせしました = Sorry to have kept you waiting.
Note: 待たせる = to keep someone waiting

658
00:35:29,774 --> 00:35:32,007
Here's the red one.

659
00:35:32,030 --> 00:35:34,730
Listening Test

660
00:35:34,730 --> 00:35:37,830
This red is so pretty!

661
00:35:37,830 --> 00:35:42,130
きれいな + 赤 + です + ね = This is a beautiful red, isn’t it?
Note: きれい (beautiful) ↔ 汚い (dirty)

662
