667
00:36:03,733 --> 00:36:08,452
重さ + は + どのくらい + ですか = How much does it weigh?
Note: 重さ = weight
どのくらい = how much / about how long

668
00:36:08,476 --> 00:36:11,509
Listening Test

669
00:36:11,509 --> 00:36:15,009
About 1 kilogram.

670
00:36:15,009 --> 00:36:19,848
1キロ + くらい + です = It’s about 1 kilo.
Note: くらい = about / approximately

671
00:36:19,871 --> 00:36:22,207
Listening Test

672
00:36:22,207 --> 00:36:24,874
That's really light!

673
00:36:24,874 --> 00:36:28,607
とても + 軽い + です = It’s very light.
Note: 軽い (light) ↔ 重い (heavy)

674
00:36:28,630 --> 00:36:30,597
Listening Test

675
00:36:30,597 --> 00:36:32,779
Sounds good!

676
00:36:35,878 --> 00:36:38,145
Listening Test

677
00:36:38,145 --> 00:36:40,713
I'll take this one.

678
00:36:40,713 --> 00:36:44,311
これ + を + ください = I’ll take this one, please.
Note: ください = please give me

679
00:36:44,335 --> 00:36:47,047
Listening Test

680
00:36:47,047 --> 00:36:50,180
Thank you.

681
